<!-- file: 01-security.mdc -->

# Security — Personal Rules
- **Secrets**: Never commit secrets. Use `.env` only.
- **Allowed providers**: OPENAI, ANTHROPIC, GOOGLE, XAI, OPENROUTER, OLLAMA.
- **Input validation**: Zod at all API boundaries.
- **Error handling**: User-facing errors must be generic; details only in logs.
- **Auth**: Use existing better-auth + OAuth; never roll custom crypto.
- **Fetch/tooling**: Only allow-listed hosts; block arbitrary SSRF.
- **Sign-up control**: Use `DISABLE_SIGN_UP=1` for solo mode.
description: Security best practices and provider restrictions
globs: ["**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx,md,json}"]
alwaysApply: true
